            Slippin' And Slidin':Buddy Holly.
Album - Reminiscing, released in '63.
It was released as a single in 1957 as
a cover to Little Richard's version. But Holly
omitted one of the verses and did only the two as I
put them down.
The original recording is in bad shape but I believe
I got it right.

